{"id":8144017457327,"title":"NMK955 VK Chronograph Case: Steel Finish","handle":"nmk955-vk-chronograph-case-steel-finish","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"592\" data-start=\"249\"\u003eFor years, Seiko modding has revolved around NH mechanical movements—but with this \u003cstrong\u003eNMK955 VK Chronograph Case\u003c\/strong\u003e, we’re shifting gears. Purpose-built for VK mecaquartz chronograph movements, this case unlocks a whole new world of modding possibilities: slimmer builds, true chronograph functions, and that satisfying snapback reset.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"866\" data-start=\"594\"\u003eInspired by the timeless silhouette of the vintage racing chronographs, the NMK955 blends classic motorsport design with modern modularity. Whether you’re building a panda dial vintage racer or a bold regatta timer, this case is the perfect foundation for your next chronograph project!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eCase Specifications:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eCase Diameter: 39mm\u003cbr\u003eLug Width: 18mm\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eLug to Lug: 46mm\u003cbr\u003eThickness:  8.1mm (Case only)\u003cbr\u003eTotal thickness: 12.5mm (Case with crystal and caseback)\u003cbr\u003eDial Size: Accepts 29.5-31.5mm Dials\u003cbr\u003eDial Opening Size: 28.5mm\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance: 10ATM\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's Included?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Pre-Assembled Boxed Crystal (Clear AR)\u003cbr\u003e- Integrated Fixed Bezel and Chapter Ring (Rehaut) available in 2 Designs\u003cbr\u003e- Matching Sterile Screw-down Crown and Chronographer Pushers\u003cbr\u003e- Brushed Caseback and Gasket\u003cbr\u003e- VK Movement Spacer\u003cbr\u003e- Springbars\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-05-22T17:02:40+08:00","created_at":"2025-01-15T17:24:15+08:00","vendor":"V